{
    "name": "§cChuck McGill",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "Jimmy's brother, a brilliant but troubled lawyer.",
    "skin": {
        "type": "CUSTOM",
        "textureId": "Chuck_McGill_1498679b"
    },
    "attributes": {
        "maxHealth": 40,
        "invulnerable": false,
        "attackableByPlayers": true,
        "attackableByMonsters": true,
        "nameVisibility": "NEVER"
    },
    "dialogs": {
        "main": {
            "greeting": "我是Chuck McGill。在这里，法律不仅仅是条文，它是一种神圣的准则。如果你寻求法律服务，请确保你的意图是纯粹的。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "§6§l接受任务",
                    "action": "OPEN_QUEST_DIALOG:RANDOM_POOL:2672f115-8ce3-4534-8ae9-e3883e5deb6d,28f2f6cb-2404-43c0-bb92-c4fbb60bb6bd,a5db9413-3781-4f21-ac46-f5b71dd19630,71a883d2-c620-4a19-b33b-1d6bf430a892,fd2881bf-3909-4506-961f-5c71948109b5",
                    "id": "btn_quest_89788d4e"
                },
                {
                    "label": "谈谈你对法律的看法",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_1",
                    "id": "btn_story"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我有一个案子需要HHM的声誉",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_intro",
                    "id": "btn_quest"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_1": {
            "greeting": "法律是文明社会的基石。它必须被严格遵守，不能有丝毫妥协。一旦我们允许为了‘方便’而扭曲规则，整个体系就会崩塌。这正是我毕生与之抗争的东西。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "这和Jimmy有关吗？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_2",
                    "id": "btn_jimmy"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回到上一级",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_2": {
            "greeting": "（叹气）Jimmy...他是个天生的破坏者。他把规则看作是建议，把法律看作是游戏。我试图引导他，保护他，甚至...阻止他。但他就像水，总能找到缝隙流走。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "你不信任他？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_3",
                    "id": "btn_trust"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回到上一级",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_1",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_3": {
            "greeting": "信任？这不仅仅是信任的问题。这是关于原则。如果我让他利用我的名字，或者利用律所的资源，我就违背了我所代表的一切。我不能为了兄弟情谊而牺牲我的职业操守。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我想聘请HHM处理事务",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_intro",
                    "id": "btn_quest"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回到上一级",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_2",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "quest_intro": {
            "greeting": "你想委托HHM？很好。我们会按照最高标准来处理。但我必须警告你，任何试图隐瞒事实、欺诈或走捷径的行为，都是我们无法容忍的。你确定你的案子经得起推敲吗？",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我需要HHM的金字招牌",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_accept"
                },
                {
                    "label": "这案子有点...灰色地带",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_decline"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "pose": "STANDING",
    "drop": {
        "item": {
            "item": "numismatic-overhaul:bronze_coin,numismatic-overhaul:silver_coin",
            "count": 15
        },
        "minCount": 15,
        "maxCount": 30,
        "chance": 0.5,
        "playerKillOnly": true
    },
